{"title":"Computer science and technology scholarships","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The following list of <b>computer science and technology scholarships</b> is primarily for American students.  This list can be reorganized to incorporate scholarship programs in other countries.  Just make that reorganization as clear and as clean as possible.\n</p><p>Additions to this list are welcomed and encouraged.  Please don't be stingy about letting students in on how they can finance their educations!  If you are unfamiliar with how to edit a Wiki and don't have time to learn, please contact <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathew_Crawford\" title=\"Mathew Crawford\">Mathew Crawford</a> using the email crawford@artofproblemsolving.com with the scholarship listing you wish to contribute.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#National_technology_scholarships\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National technology scholarships</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Minority-specific_technology_scholarships\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Minority-specific technology scholarships</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#State-specific_technology_scholarships\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">State-specific technology scholarships</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Teaching_Fellowships_and_Grants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Teaching Fellowships and Grants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_technology_scholarships\">National technology scholarships</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science_and_technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: National technology scholarships\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Microsoft <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://careers.microsoft.com/careers/en/us/collegescholarship.aspx\">Computer science scholarships</a> with full or partial tuition and a salaried summer internship.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Robert_Half_Technology_Scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Robert Half Technology Scholarships (page does not exist)\">Robert Half Technology Scholarships</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.aitp.org/ncc/ncc2008/aitp/RHT-AITPScholarship.html\">Website</a> (NOTE: website address changes each year)</li>\n<li>Federal Cyber Service: Scholarship for Service. Full tuition and stipends for undergraduate and graduate students in exchange for service at a federal agency. At participating institutions only. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.sfs.opm.gov/\">website</a></li>\n<li>Information Assurance Scholarship Program. Scholarship funding for undergraduate and graduate students in exchange for serving DoD as a full-time employee after graduation. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://cio-nii.defense.gov/sites/iasp2/\">website</a></li>\n<li>HostingAdvice.com Future Web Developers Annual Scholarship <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.hostingadvice.com/scholarship/\">[1]</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Minority-specific_technology_scholarships\">Minority-specific technology scholarships</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science_and_technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Minority-specific technology scholarships\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Anita_Borg_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Anita Borg Scholarship (page does not exist)\">Anita Borg Scholarship</a> for female undergraduate and graduate students.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.google.com/anitaborg/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Google_Hispanic_College_Fund_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Google Hispanic College Fund Scholarship (page does not exist)\">Google Hispanic College Fund Scholarship</a> for Hispanic undergraduate or graduate students. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scholarships.hispanicfund.org/applications/subsectionID.1,pageID.123/default.asp\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Google_Lime_Scholarship_for_Students_with_Disabilities&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Google Lime Scholarship for Students with Disabilities (page does not exist)\">Google Lime Scholarship for Students with Disabilities</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.limeconnect.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Google_United_Negro_College_Fund_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Google United Negro College Fund Scholarship (page does not exist)\">Google United Negro College Fund Scholarship</a> for African-American undergraduate or graduate students. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.uncf.org/forstudents/scholarDetailSGA.asp?id=438\">Website</a></li>\n<li>Society of Women Engineer <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.swe.org/scholarships/brochure.aspx\">scholarships</a> for female college and graduate students majoring in engineering or computer science.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Xerox&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Xerox (page does not exist)\">Xerox</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technical_Minority_Scholarship_Program&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Technical Minority Scholarship Program (page does not exist)\">Technical Minority Scholarship Program</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.xerox.com/go/xrx/template/009.jsp?view=Feature&amp;Xcntry=USA&amp;Xlang=en_US&amp;ed_name=Careers_Technical_Scholarship\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"State-specific_technology_scholarships\">State-specific technology scholarships</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science_and_technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: State-specific technology scholarships\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Siegel_Service_Technology_Scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Siegel Service Technology Scholarships (page does not exist)\">Siegel Service Technology Scholarships</a> for undergraduates in Montana.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://students.sae.org/awdscholar/scholarships/siegel/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Michigan_Council_of_Women_in_Technology_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Michigan Council of Women in Technology Scholarship (page does not exist)\">Michigan Council of Women in Technology Scholarship</a> for female students who are residents of Michigan. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mcwtf.org/Scholarships_149.html\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Teaching_Fellowships_and_Grants\">Teaching Fellowships and Grants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science_and_technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Teaching Fellowships and Grants\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>New Jersey Department of Education <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.state.nj.us/njded/techno/fellowship/\">Technology Fellowships for Mentors and Modeling</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.colleges.org/techcenter/fellowships.html\">ACS Teaching and Technology Fellowships</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science_and_technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics,_science,_and_technology_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics, science, and technology scholarships\">Mathematics, science, and technology scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_competitions\" title=\"Technology competitions\">Technology competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_summer_programs\" title=\"Technology summer programs\">Technology summer programs</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP lim